        "Restrictive covenants in senior hires, some employers still prefer wet ink or witnessed execution for high-value roles, though electronic signatures are generally valid.",
        "Share schemes and EMI agreements, check your scheme rules; HMRC and company law requirements may specify additional execution formalities.",
